{"3120030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Day I Became a Bird", "steam_appid": 3120030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4396130, 4396140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“When she speaks, Her voice sounds like birdsong…”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Day I Became a Bird is a heartwarming and handcrafted narrative-adventure game. Telling the tender tale of a young boy, Frank, on his fledgling journey of fluttering feelings, innocent self-expression and honest ingenuity. A story of beaks, feathers, and heartfelt birdsong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable bedtime story, follow Frank through a slice of his life - biking to school, running around the park, completing puzzles, making memories, and discovering newfound feelings for his classmate, Sylvia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Frank learn more about her, uncover her interests, and ultimately hatch a plan to catch her eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come along for a warm and nostalgic return to childhood, this is one for the hopeful romantics. Let your hearts flutter, spread your wings, and soar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“When she speaks, Her voice sounds like birdsong…”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Day I Became a Bird is a heartwarming and handcrafted narrative-adventure game. Telling the tender tale of a young boy, Frank, on his fledgling journey of fluttering feelings, innocent self-expression and honest ingenuity. A story of beaks, feathers, and heartfelt birdsong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable bedtime story, follow Frank through a slice of his life - biking to school, running around the park, completing puzzles, making memories, and discovering newfound feelings for his classmate, Sylvia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Frank learn more about her, uncover her interests, and ultimately hatch a plan to catch her eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come along for a warm and nostalgic return to childhood, this is one for the hopeful romantics. Let your hearts flutter, spread your wings, and soar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Join Frank, an awkward young boy, as he discovers newfound feelings for his classmate, Sylvia - who only has eyes for birds. Explore, collect, and solve puzzles as Frank attempts to catch her attention with a homespun, feathery transformation in this warm and nostalgic return to childhood.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/header.jpg?t=1776320494", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/a3ebd1667f087517e75153a9096130f9b9e015e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776320494", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120030/a3ebd1667f087517e75153a9096130f9b9e015e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776320494", "website": "https://numskullgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 6